<title>USA: Summa to buy back additional shrs.</title>
<headline>Summa to buy back additional shrs.</headline>
<dateline>MANCHESTER, N.H. 1997-01-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Summa Four Inc said on Wednesday that its board authorized the purchase of up to an additional 500,000 shares of the company's common stock.</p>
<p>The authorization extends the Stock Repurchase Program adopted by the company on July 21, 1994, which has been completed.</p>
<p>Purchased shares will be held in treasury for use in funding the Summa Four's stock option and other stock compensation programs, the company said.</p>
<p>-- ((New York newsdesk 212-859-1611))</p>
</text>
